      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This needs to be done, sìnce I have known people talking to devs of both VRChat and Epic Games (the maker of the EAC), and all we have been gettjng are copy-paste answers saying \"It’s not us, you need to talk to the right people,\" without telling us who the \"right people\" are. At this point, does there need to be threat of a lawsuit to get anything to change? Punishing players who haven't done anything wrong can't be legal, and someone needs to be held accountable.",
